# Site facts for the four-Spark ring. Copy to launcher/hosts.env on every node (same recipe path everywhere) and
# edit. Every address here is an EXAMPLE. Plain KEY=VALUE lines; a variable already set in the environment wins.
#
# Rank order must follow the cable ring: rank r's QSFP port 0 is cabled to rank (r+1) mod 4's port 1
# (0-1-2-3-0, no diagonal cables). vllm-patches-roce hardcodes this pairing.

# Management-LAN addresses: torch.distributed master (rank 0), gloo and NCCL bootstrap, VLLM_HOST_IP, the API.
RANK0_IP=10.0.0.10
RANK1_IP=10.0.0.11
RANK2_IP=10.0.0.12
RANK3_IP=10.0.0.13

# ssh targets ring-up.sh and the ring-wide scripts use from rank 0 (default: [SSH_USER@]RANKn_IP). Key-based,
# non-interactive (BatchMode) ssh from rank 0 to ranks 1-3 is required.
SSH_USER=
#RANK1_SSH=user@10.0.0.11

# Management interface for NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME / GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME (enP7s7 is the DGX Spark's onboard RJ45 port).
MGMT_IFNAME=enP7s7
# torch.distributed master port on rank 0.
MASTER_PORT=25026

# One fabric check per cable, run by ring-up.sh before launch: "<rank>:<neighbour's fabric IPv4>" pinged from that
# rank. Example plan (README "Hardware and cabling"): rank r's port-0 domain-0 function is .1 and the neighbour's
# port-1 domain-0 function is .2 on 10.200.(2r+1).0/24.
LINK_CHECKS="0:10.200.1.2 1:10.200.3.2 2:10.200.5.2 3:10.200.7.2"

# Checkpoint directory (identical content on every node; see launcher/fetch-checkpoint.py).
MODEL_HOST=/srv/models/MiMo-V2.6-Flash-MOPD/2479e2d0029eca9a34cc7e7f55a121925f81908e
# API keys, one per line, readable by the docker user. Must exist on all four nodes: every rank parses the same
# command line, although only rank 0 serves HTTP. It is bind-mounted read-only and read at exec time, so no key
# appears in `docker inspect`.
API_KEY_FILE=/etc/mimo26/api-keys
# Patched NCCL 2.30.7 (nccl/build-nccl.sh). NCCL_DUAL=1 (production) uses NCCL_DUAL_SO; NCCL_DUAL=0 uses NCCL_SO.
# The same library serves both: its two routing flags default off.
NCCL_DUAL_SO=$HOME/nccl-dual-pci/libnccl.so.2
NCCL_SO=$HOME/nccl-dual-pci/libnccl.so.2
# b12x checkouts live at $B12X_ROOT/<short sha> (the profile's B12X=e4084d2e -> $HOME/b12x/e4084d2e).
B12X_ROOT=$HOME/b12x
# Per-rank state: vLLM / FlashInfer / b12x caches, memory-guard state and log.
STATE=$HOME/vllm-mimo26-state
